{
  "parse": {
    "title": "Honeyhives",
    "pageid": 133933,
    "revid": 828542,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Honeyhives</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Bee_Nest.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Bee Nest.png\"><img alt=\"Bee Nest.png\" src=\"/images/Bee_Nest.png?fc81c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Honeyhives</b> are structures in the <a href=\"/w/Torrhus_Canyon\" title=\"Torrhus Canyon\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Torrhus Canyon</span></a>. They are the primary source of <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Overview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Overview</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Possible_Loot\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Possible Loot</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Beekeeper_Perk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Beekeeper Perk</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Overview\">Overview</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Overview\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Overview\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Honeyhives</b> are found all across the <a href=\"/w/Torrhus_Canyon\" title=\"Torrhus Canyon\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Torrhus Canyon</span></a>. They can be interacted with to obtain <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a>. Additionally, the player has a chance to obtain <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Honeycomb\" title=\"Enchanted Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Honeycomb.png/21px-Enchanted_Honeycomb.png?816c0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Honeycomb.png/42px-Enchanted_Honeycomb.png?816c0 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Honeycomb\" title=\"Enchanted Honeycomb\">Enchanted Honeycomb</a>, <span><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>, and a random bee-related <a href=\"/w/Shard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shard\">Shard</a>. The <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz_Shard\" title=\"Honeybuzz Shard\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeybuzz_Shard.png/21px-Honeybuzz_Shard.png?2537b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeybuzz_Shard.png/42px-Honeybuzz_Shard.png?2537b 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz_Shard\" title=\"Honeybuzz Shard\">Honeybuzz Shard</a>'s <a href=\"/w/Attributes#Honey_Haul\" title=\"Attributes\"><span class=\"color-gold bold\">Honey Haul</span></a> attribute grants a chance to double the amount of <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a> obtained.\n</p><p>A <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz\" title=\"Honeybuzz\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Honeybuzz in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bee_Sprite.png/16px-Bee_Sprite.png?0919d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bee_Sprite.png/32px-Bee_Sprite.png?0919d 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz\" title=\"Honeybuzz\">Honeybuzz</a> has a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">50%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">2</span></span>) chance<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-honeybuzz-chance&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-honeybuzz-chance-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> to spawn upon looting a <b>Honeyhive</b>. This yields the following message:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-f\"><span class=\"format-o\">A </span></span><span class=\"format-7\"><span class=\"format-o\">Honeybuzz </span></span><span class=\"format-f\"><span class=\"format-o\">appeared, angry at you for stealing its honey!</span></span></div></div>\n<p>Looting a <b>Honeyhive</b> yields the following message:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-7\"><span class=\"format-o\">You stick your hand into the honeyhive and feel around...</span></span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">HIVE! </span></span><span class=\"format-f\">You found Honeycome </span><span class=\"format-8\">x# </span><span class=\"format-7\">and </span><span class=\"format-8\">&lt;extra loot&gt;</span><span class=\"format-f\">!</span></div></div>\n<p>Looting a <b>Honeyhive</b> causes it to go on cooldown for <span class=\"light-color color-green\">60m</span>. The <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Queen_Bee_Shard\" title=\"Queen Bee Shard\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Queen_Bee_Shard.png/21px-Queen_Bee_Shard.png?fac73\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Queen_Bee_Shard.png/42px-Queen_Bee_Shard.png?fac73 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Queen_Bee_Shard\" title=\"Queen Bee Shard\">Queen Bee Shard</a>'s <a href=\"/w/Attributes#Honey_Refill\" title=\"Attributes\"><span class=\"color-gold bold\">Honey Refill</span></a> <a href=\"/w/Attribute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attribute\">Attribute</a> grants a chance to instantly refill the <b>Honeyhive</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Possible_Loot\">Possible Loot</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Possible Loot\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Possible Loot\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Honeyhives</b> are guaranteed to drop <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">16–<abbr title=\"1 stack\" tabindex=\"0\">64</abbr></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycombs</a> and another item from the pool:<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-honeyhive-drops&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-honeyhive-drops-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable ct\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Slot\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Weight\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;61,750 Coins\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"1,750 Coins\"><img alt=\"Coins\" src=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Emerald%29.png/32px-Coins_%28Emerald%29.png?d4758\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Emerald%29.png/64px-Coins_%28Emerald%29.png?d4758 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span><span class=\"invslot-stacksize\" title=\"1,750 Coins\" style=\"font-size:9px;right:-1px\">1750</span></span></span></td>\n<td><span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>1,000–2,500</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">100</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">20.83%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">4.8</span></span>&#32;rolls)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"uncommon\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;aEnchanted Honeycomb\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Collection Item//&amp;7A block of sparkling honey. It smells/&amp;7incredible.//&amp;eRight-click to view recipes!//&amp;a&amp;lUNCOMMON\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Honeycomb\" title=\"Enchanted Honeycomb\"><img alt=\"Enchanted Honeycomb\" src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Honeycomb.png/32px-Enchanted_Honeycomb.png?816c0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Honeycomb.png/64px-Enchanted_Honeycomb.png?816c0 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Honeycomb\" title=\"Enchanted Honeycomb\">Enchanted Honeycomb</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">200</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">41.67%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">2.4</span></span>&#32;rolls)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;63,750 Coins\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"3,750 Coins\"><img alt=\"Coins\" src=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Redstone%29.png/32px-Coins_%28Redstone%29.png?31c92\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Redstone%29.png/64px-Coins_%28Redstone%29.png?31c92 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span><span class=\"invslot-stacksize\" title=\"3,750 Coins\" style=\"font-size:9px;right:-1px\">3750</span></span></span></td>\n<td><span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>2,500–5,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">50</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">10.42%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">9.6</span></span>&#32;rolls)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;fHoneybuzz Shard\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;6Honey Haul I/&amp;6Honeyhives &amp;7have a &amp;a+2.5% &amp;7chance to/&amp;7contain double the &amp;6Honeycomb&amp;7.//&amp;7You can Syphon this shard from/&amp;7your &amp;aHunting Box&amp;7.//&amp;eRight-click to send to Hunting Box!/&amp;eShift Right-click to move all!//&amp;f&amp;lCOMMON FOREST SHARD &amp;8(ID C64)\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz_Shard\" title=\"Honeybuzz Shard\"><img alt=\"Honeybuzz Shard\" src=\"/images/thumb/Honeybuzz_Shard.png/32px-Honeybuzz_Shard.png?2537b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeybuzz_Shard.png/64px-Honeybuzz_Shard.png?2537b 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeybuzz_Shard\" title=\"Honeybuzz Shard\">Honeybuzz Shard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">120</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">25%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">4</span></span>&#32;rolls)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"epic\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;5Queen Bee Shard\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;6Honey Refill I/&amp;6Honeyhives &amp;7have a &amp;a+0.5% &amp;7chance to/&amp;7refill instantly.//&amp;7You can Syphon this shard from/&amp;7your &amp;aHunting Box&amp;7.//&amp;eRight-click to send to Hunting Box!/&amp;eShift Right-click to move all!//&amp;4❣ &amp;cRequires &amp;aHunting Skill 15&amp;c./&amp;5&amp;lEPIC FOREST SHARD &amp;8(ID E49)\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Queen_Bee_Shard\" title=\"Queen Bee Shard\"><img alt=\"Queen Bee Shard\" src=\"/images/thumb/Queen_Bee_Shard.png/32px-Queen_Bee_Shard.png?fac73\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Queen_Bee_Shard.png/64px-Queen_Bee_Shard.png?fac73 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Queen_Bee_Shard\" title=\"Queen Bee Shard\">Queen Bee Shard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">10</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">2.08%</span>&#32;(<span><span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span>&#160;in&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">48.0</span></span>&#32;rolls)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Beekeeper_Perk\">Beekeeper Perk</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Beekeeper Perk\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Beekeeper Perk\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Having <a href=\"/w/Heart_of_the_Forest#Tier_8\" title=\"Heart of the Forest\">Beekeeper</a> unlocked in the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Heart_of_the_Forest\" title=\"Heart of the Forest\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Heart_of_the_Forest.png/21px-Heart_of_the_Forest.png?5a002\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Heart_of_the_Forest.png/42px-Heart_of_the_Forest.png?5a002 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Heart_of_the_Forest\" title=\"Heart of the Forest\">Heart of the Forest</a> allows the player to gain a random effect that benefits <b>Honeyhives</b>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Possible Effect\n</th>\n<th>Weight\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/Honeyhive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honeyhive\"><span class=\"color-gold\">Honeyhives</span></a> refill <span class=\"light-color color-green\">20%</span> faster.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><sup><abbr title=\"More infomation needed; When this info is added, remove this.\"><i>[More Info Needed]</i></abbr></sup>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\">25</span> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span> in <span class=\"light-color color-yellow\">4</span> rolls)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">Trees</span> lathered with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a> attract <a href=\"/w/Critters\" title=\"Critters\">Critters</a> <span class=\"light-color color-green\">20%</span> faster.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gain <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/21px-Honeycomb.png?a6559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeycomb.png/42px-Honeycomb.png?a6559 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">2</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Honeycomb\" title=\"Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a> from <a href=\"/w/Honeyhive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honeyhive\"><span class=\"color-gold\">Honeyhives</span></a> and lathering <span class=\"light-color color-green\">Trees</span> with <a href=\"/w/Pot_of_Honeycombs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pot of Honeycombs\">Honeycomb</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"light-color color-green\">Trees</span> lathered with <a href=\"/w/Pot_of_Honeycombs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pot of Honeycombs\">Honeycomb</a> have a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">25%</span> chance to attract a second <a href=\"/w/Critter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critter\">Critter</a>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Honeyhives?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Honeyhive_Render.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An active honeyhive\"><img alt=\"An active honeyhive\" src=\"/images/thumb/Honeyhive_Render.png/82px-Honeyhive_Render.png?fc6eb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"82\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Honeyhive_Render.png/165px-Honeyhive_Render.png?fc6eb 2x\" data-file-width=\"550\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An active honeyhive</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Inactive_Honeyhive_Render.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An inactive honeyhive\"><img alt=\"An inactive honeyhive\" src=\"/images/thumb/Inactive_Honeyhive_Render.png/111px-Inactive_Honeyhive_Render.png?ce73d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"111\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" s